<title>USA: American Express in Banco Excel card deal.</title>
<headline>American Express in Banco Excel card deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Express Co said on Monday that it had agreed with Brazil's Banco Excel Economico to launch a new credit card.</p>
<p>The partnership marks American Express's third network agreement in Brazil and is &quot;intended to increase (Banco Excel's) customer base and strengthen its brand, the credit card company said.</p>
<p>The new card, called the Excel Card American Express, will be issued by Banco Excel Economico and will be accepted by all merchants in the American Express global network, American Express said.</p>
</text>
